=== the request, as the daemon received it
{ "action": "stats", "domain": "beta", "arg": "frontend" }

=== the entry it contributes to beta
{
  "type": "fuse",
  "stagedFiles": 9,
  "pid": 18103,
  "uptimeSeconds": 3600.0,
  "cpuSeconds": 35.5,
  "rssBytes": 57638912,
  "traffic": { "bytesUploaded": 4096 }
}

=== a socket nothing is bound to
{
  "type": "fuse",
  "reachable": false,
  "socketPath": "<socket>",
  "error": "<error>"
}

